{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"x":0.096623133699720962,"w":0.11745332082112632,"t":"Introduction","c":1,"y":0.065057860467485851,"h":0.015233116239765643},{"x":0.098765433269770803,"y":0.11189634873237941,"h":0.016010628150966877,"c":1,"t":"MARKING THE PRACTICE TESTS","w":0.43621398925781252},{"y":0.147478618061476,"w":0.25158505757649735,"h":0.019815245000437076,"x":0.098493633708666081,"c":1,"t":"Listening and Reading"},{"x":0.098765438162932456,"t":"The Answer Keys are on pages 116-123.","w":0.37654319763183597,"y":0.17285041236070664,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"x":0.10082304453528033,"c":1,"w":0.61522633870442711,"t":"Each question in the Listening and Reading tests is worth one mark.","y":0.1918604649698924,"h":0.016031172025610885},{"y":0.22819767427129412,"t":"Questions which require letter \/ Roman numeral answers","w":0.53703704833984378,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.10082303949496785},{"x":0.096651518819676124,"c":1,"w":0.81698425292968746,"h":0.018140176159754273,"t":"• For questions where the answers are letters or Roman numerals, you should write only","y":0.24974250304033518},{"x":0.12551440063483058,"y":0.26737338052559934,"h":0.01751034054795475,"w":0.79423868815104182,"t":"the number of answers required. For example, if the answer is a single letter or numeral","c":1},{"y":0.28621908103442328,"t":"you should write only one answer. If you have written more letters or numerals than are","x":0.12551439345008275,"w":0.78600824991861995,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"x":0.12551440004047132,"h":0.017481236631934904,"c":1,"t":"required, the answer must be marked wrong.","w":0.40946502685546871,"y":0.30377906960473022},{"w":0.62345677693684887,"t":"Questions which require answers in the form of words or numbers","h":0.015998644317698818,"c":1,"x":0.10082305172629863,"y":0.34010600698460502},{"y":0.36093059729391963,"w":0.46108627319335938,"t":"• Answers may be written in upper or lower case.","c":1,"x":0.096609193984839692,"h":0.019146632811205988},{"c":1,"t":"• Words in brackets are optional - they are correct, but not necessary.","w":0.64814814249674479,"h":0.01751376490149259,"x":0.096707821624845564,"y":0.38074204920484089},{"y":0.39811542991370663,"h":0.016195524146054296,"t":"• Alternative answers are separated by a slash (\/).","w":0.4711934407552083,"x":0.096707806273927166,"c":1},{"x":0.096707824792530636,"w":0.73868311564127609,"c":1,"t":"•f you are asked to write an answer using a certain number of words and\/or (a)","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.41715116265804675},{"h":0.017441860778592999,"y":0.43459302309659809,"x":0.12551440978552705,"w":0.79012344360351561,"c":1,"t":"number(s), you will be penalised if you exceed this. For example, if a question specifies"},{"h":0.014567411690072918,"w":0.76337448120117191,"t":"an answer using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS and the correct answer is 'black","x":0.12757201857791756,"y":0.45200235587979809,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.46694065221308712,"h":0.020413806497418752,"t":"leather coat, the answer 'coat of black leather' is incorrect.","x":0.12338022931389522,"w":0.535117696126302},{"x":0.096660659831255769,"w":0.79434371948242188,"y":0.48654217810224476,"c":1,"h":0.019062015277336752,"t":"• In questions where you are expected to complete a gap, you should only transfer the"},{"w":0.78806584676106772,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"necessary missing word(s) onto the answer sheet. For example, to complete 'in the ...,","y":0.50581395334205692,"x":0.12757201479837665},{"w":0.77366256713867188,"t":"where the correct answer is 'morning', the answer 'in the morning' would be incorrect.","x":0.12757200852405162,"y":0.52179034157295945,"h":0.018907332448431458,"c":1},{"w":0.6193415832519531,"y":0.54063604264047715,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.096707808832925415,"t":"• All answers require correct spelling (including words in brackets)."},{"c":1,"y":0.55616079131984775,"t":"• Both US and UK spelling are acceptable and are included in the Answer Key.","x":0.096644926937242234,"w":0.72648249308268231,"h":0.019473091592777436},{"y":0.57703488357473953,"x":0.096707820398288888,"h":0.016015764400450716,"t":"• All standard alternatives for numbers, dates and currencies are acceptable.","w":0.71193415323893228,"c":1},{"w":0.41398234049479166,"c":1,"t":"• All standard abbreviations are acceptable.","y":0.59158663134239331,"h":0.018975373572539422,"x":0.096551590844396559},{"c":1,"x":0.096653454334632058,"h":0.017602212858705557,"t":"• You will find additional notes about individual answers in the Answer Key.","y":0.61035335920713363,"w":0.69148086547851573},{"t":"Writing","x":0.099748719400223437,"y":0.63994642535741386,"w":0.084753627777099619,"h":0.020702694554772583,"c":1},{"x":0.10082303605957037,"w":0.83744857788085947,"h":0.016005492463128768,"y":0.66715116264504692,"c":1,"t":"The sample answers are on pages 124-131. It is not possible for you to give yourself a mark"},{"x":0.098765435997215809,"t":"for the Writing tasks. We have provided sample answers (written by candidates), showing","c":1,"h":0.017441860778592999,"w":0.80864196777343744,"y":0.68459302309060877},{"c":1,"w":0.80864196777343755,"t":"their score and the examiner's comments. These sample answers will give you an insight","y":0.70347467621770976,"h":0.016002068109590928,"x":0.098765435782504393},{"w":0.36459711710611986,"x":0.098593092604101901,"h":0.018844279861000901,"t":"into what is required for the Writing test.","y":0.71854186207190573,"c":1},{"y":0.93895348812372526,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.10082304508611735,"w":0.014403292338053389,"c":1,"t":"8"},{"y":0.96768673599438859,"x":0.394839595538719,"t":"leltsresources.org","h":0.016448737594910057,"w":0.20826686859130855,"c":1}]}